    "title": "Stateline organizations advocate against gifting pets for holidays - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brea Walters ,\n15 hours ago ROCKFORD, Ill. (WIFR) - Animal service workers agree that pets look cute under a Christmas tree, but people should think twice before giving them as a holiday gift. Freya, a crested gecko, lives at Eclectic Exotics Rescue and Rehab. Before that, she was given to someone as a Christmas gift. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
